!Sample_data_processing = Images analysis and base calling was done using the solexa pipeline
!Sample_data_processing = For all samples reads were aligned to their indicated build usiwng bowtie2 (version 2.2.1) with parameters -k 1
!Sample_data_processing = Normalized read density of a ChIP-seq dataset in any genomic region was calculated using Bamliquidator (version 1.0) read density calculator (https://github.com/BradnerLab/pipeline/wiki/bamliquidator).
!Sample_data_processing = MACS version 1.4.2 (Model based analysis of ChIP-seq) peak finding algorithm was used to identify regions of ChIP-seq enrichment over background and to generate .wig files for visualization. A p-value threshold of enrichment of 1e-9 was used for all datasets
